{
  "$comment": [
    "READY-TO-USE TEMPLATE — FAQPage.",
    "Rule that matters: every question and answer here MUST appear, word for word, in the",
    "visible HTML of the same page. Marking up questions the user cannot see is a",
    "structured-data violation. Answers may contain a little inline HTML (<a>, <strong>,",
